Subject: [PATCH] Match Google 1.10 haploid/PAR likelihoods and gVCF confidence (#1103)

Google v1.10.0 postprocess_variants.py:1070-1092,1197-1204,1300-1307
zero and renormalize heterozygous mass after merging and simplifying.
variant_caller.py:220-257,323-334 uses log10(Phet)=-999 before
normalization and GQ binning. GT and PL remain diploid-encoded, as upstream.

